 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "finish is a positive integer and scooters is a list of distinct non-negative integer positions. You start at 0 and move right only. At any scooter position you may take that scooter, leaving any scooter you ride; a scooter carries you at most 10 units to the right. Every unit not covered by a scooter is walked. Return the minimum total distance walked to reach finish, which equals finish minus the length of the union of the segments [s, min(s + 10, finish)] over scooters s < finish.",
  "provenance": [
